  "id": 8834346778823,
  "title": "Custom Basketball Players Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "custom-basketball-players-blanket-name-number-76fdad09b6-76fdad09b6",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in game-day comfort with this custom basketball players blanket from Jeminise. Perfect for basketball lovers, this personalized sports blanket allows you to add your custom name and number, making it a truly unique and thoughtful gift for players, boys, kids, and fans of the game. Designed for year-round warmth, it serves as a cozy layer for your bed, a comfortable throw for lounging on the sofa, or a handy companion for travel, camping, and outdoor picnics.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customization options with up to two text inputs for your custom name and number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Sporty Basketball Theme:</strong> Showcases a vibrant graphic illustration of basketball players with a splatter paint and halftone dot background.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Fabric Options:</strong> Available in both ultra-soft Sherpa and smooth Fleece fabric styles crafted with double-layered polyester for lightweight comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for cuddling up on the couch, sleeping in bed, traveling, or using outdoors during camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water for quick drying and easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes:</strong> Offered in four distinct sizes to suit everyone from babies to adults: Small (40x30 in), Medium (50x40 in), Large (60x50 in), and X-Large (80x60 in).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Basketball Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches) | Medium (50x40 inches) | Large (60x50 inches) | X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
